@startuml UC-59
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-59.md
title UC-59: Activate / Deactivate Voucher
footer Feature AVOU-02 | Business rules: BR-07, BR-11, BR-26
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "Admin/VouchersController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "VoucherService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Admin

U -> MVC : Toggle voucher on / off
MVC -> API : PATCH /api/admin/vouchers/{id}/active { isActive }
API -> SVC : SetActiveAsync(id, isActive)
SVC -> DB : Find voucher
alt not found
  SVC --> API : NotFound
  API --> MVC : 404 Not Found
  MVC --> U : Show "Not found"
else found
  SVC -> DB : Set IsActive\nSaveChangesAsync
note right of SVC : Inactive vouchers cannot be applied\nto new orders (BR-26)
  SVC --> API : OK
  API --> MVC : 204 No Content
  MVC --> U : Show updated state
end

@enduml
